  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacities of Border Municipalities in the Brazilian Amazon to Face the Challenges of Migration, Climate Change and Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this Joint Programme is to contribute to addressing the compound challenges posed by migration, climate change, and health issues and increasing access of migrants to essential health services in border municipalities in the Brazilian Amazon, aiming at strengthening policy coherence, building capacities of the local healthcare systems, and improving community health, including among cross-border indigenous peoples.</narrative>
  </description>
